# Neptuno live-ISO flatpaks
# Installed into the live squashfs at build time (committed to layer, not cache).
# Copied offline to the target by bootc-installer during installation
# (flatpak_var_path=var/lib/flatpak per iso/neptuno.conf).
#
# Note: org.bootcinstaller.Installer is installed separately via the GitHub
# Releases bundle (not on Flathub) earlier in install-flatpaks.sh.
# GNOME Disks and Files (Nautilus) are not Flatpaks on Flathub — they ship as
# RPMs in the Silverblue base image and are already present in the live env.
#
# Format: one app ID per line, resolved from the flathub remote.
